  "description": "KI/KI’s rise has accelerated throughout 2026, with the Dutch trance-techno star taking on increasingly major festival and arena stages that are well-suited to her high-speed sound.\n\nHer release rollout this year included ‘5AM’, ‘Going Existential In The Rave’, ‘Here With Me’ and ‘Arp12’, the latter a mega collaboration with the UK electronic pioneers Underworld. She has also remixed Romy’s ‘Love Who You Love’. Her live schedule has been equally ambitious: after a sold-out tour across Europe, Australia and North and South America earlier in the year, she is set to make her Ziggo Dome debut during ADE in October with two five-hour headline shows.",
